# NeMo Gym — code ownership and reviewer suggestions
#
# Package entries use `# suggest:` so Suggest Reviewers can request their
# teams without making GitHub's native code-owner approval a package gate.
# The portable check in scripts/ci/check-review-approvals.sh reads standard
# rules AND `# suggest:` entries in file order; the last match wins.
#
# Each package lists its specialist team. A team containing exactly
# Ananth and Yuya is automatically satisfied by the portable check;
# optional teams are still suggested.
#
# Membership is managed in GitHub Teams under gym_team. Keep specific rules
# after broader ones. Standard CI and BioNeMo rules retain native ownership.

# Maintainer fallback for the portable check and reviewer suggestions.
